  keywordNote: "<b>이름 주의</b>: Dataplex Universal Catalog = <mark>Knowledge Catalog</mark>, Vertex AI = <mark>Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform(Agent Platform)</mark>, Cloud Run 関数 = Cloud Run functions. 일본어 표기: 検出 / カタログ / <mark>自動データ品質</mark> / レイク.",
  whyWrong: "",
